WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Your eyes see one hand. Your skin feels another.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Match the timing, and what belongs to you can feel uncertain.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A reported feeling is evidence of the report, not every proposed cause.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Separate a product's format from its promises.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine, then check the source.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Choose with the evidence in view.
